    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/1373a9b27db382dbc166ff88516438e6.poster.avif?t=1738253705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/1373a9b27db382dbc166ff88516438e6.webm?t=1738253705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/1373a9b27db382dbc166ff88516438e6.mp4?t=1738253705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/8f85cb50f0b7299b6d7bd5aa74c9cfec.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a universe regulated by a balance between Life and Oblivion, embodied by the spirit Ikimaki and the demon Bokyaku, Nerobi no longer has memory and self-awareness. He finds himself in the Middle World, the place where the Essences must pass before reincarnating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the Middle World is invaded by Demons. So, as he discovers his past and his identity, Nerobi will be called to exercise his hidden powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/741b96b2b112bf22a1ff60c123a3ac95.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/8f85cb50f0b7299b6d7bd5aa74c9cfec.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a 2D scrolling platformer with several elements typical of a graphic adventure, featuring some cinematic sequences. <strong>It is all hand-drawn</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is <strong>definitely challenging</strong>: it takes coordination, timing, and you have to use your wits. Different powers are unlocked as you go along, expanding the gameplay experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, scattered around the world, there are several hidden <strong>cards to collect</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/d35303e288f2d8f51ac09d2ad7c96f64.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/f164937ff7537fbdf3b880e4b608ea9f.poster.avif?t=1738253705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/f164937ff7537fbdf3b880e4b608ea9f.webm?t=1738253705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/f164937ff7537fbdf3b880e4b608ea9f.mp4?t=1738253705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/8f85cb50f0b7299b6d7bd5aa74c9cfec.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Totally hand-drawn visual experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Immersive and exciting story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Challenging gameplay along the lines of old arcade games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Puzzles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Powers to unlock that expand the gameplay experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Engaging soundtrack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Hidden collectible cards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/0416ff664b24d8bb4f91f9f9a80c295a.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/1373a9b27db382dbc166ff88516438e6.poster.avif?t=1738253705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/1373a9b27db382dbc166ff88516438e6.webm?t=1738253705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/1373a9b27db382dbc166ff88516438e6.mp4?t=1738253705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/8f85cb50f0b7299b6d7bd5aa74c9cfec.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a universe regulated by a balance between Life and Oblivion, embodied by the spirit Ikimaki and the demon Bokyaku, Nerobi no longer has memory and self-awareness. He finds himself in the Middle World, the place where the Essences must pass before reincarnating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the Middle World is invaded by Demons. So, as he discovers his past and his identity, Nerobi will be called to exercise his hidden powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/741b96b2b112bf22a1ff60c123a3ac95.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/8f85cb50f0b7299b6d7bd5aa74c9cfec.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a 2D scrolling platformer with several elements typical of a graphic adventure, featuring some cinematic sequences. <strong>It is all hand-drawn</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is <strong>definitely challenging</strong>: it takes coordination, timing, and you have to use your wits. Different powers are unlocked as you go along, expanding the gameplay experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, scattered around the world, there are several hidden <strong>cards to collect</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/d35303e288f2d8f51ac09d2ad7c96f64.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/f164937ff7537fbdf3b880e4b608ea9f.poster.avif?t=1738253705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/f164937ff7537fbdf3b880e4b608ea9f.webm?t=1738253705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/f164937ff7537fbdf3b880e4b608ea9f.mp4?t=1738253705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/8f85cb50f0b7299b6d7bd5aa74c9cfec.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Totally hand-drawn visual experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Immersive and exciting story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Challenging gameplay along the lines of old arcade games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Puzzles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Powers to unlock that expand the gameplay experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Engaging soundtrack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Hidden collectible cards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534250/extras/0416ff664b24d8bb4f91f9f9a80c295a.avif?t=1738253705\" /></span></p>",
